# Website assets (Buildschmiede site)

## Original chrome — invent / generate freely

Agents **MAY invent and generate** original UI chrome and textures for the website
(`src/`, assembled `index.html` / `synergien.html`) from their own ideas:

- CSS, SVG, hand-made or AI-generated PNG/WebP
- Layout, panels, tabs, borders, corners, backgrounds, ornaments — all original

No need to wait for hand-drawn assets or to mimic client art. Prefer coherent,
site-owned visuals over looking like the game client.

## Forbidden: Ascension / WoW BLP and 1:1 client chrome

Never copy or embed client **BLP** (or BLP-converted) panel chrome into the site,
and never ship **1:1** client UI frame kits, including but not limited to:

- DialogFrame / UI-Panel / PaperDoll tab art
- `caCorner` and similar frame-kit corners/borders
- Full UI frame kits from Interface extracts

Read-only research in client extracts is fine; shipping those textures (or
pixel-identical recreations) as site chrome is not.

## Allowed from client extracts

**Spell and item icons only** — via the existing pipeline (`sprite.webp` /
`spriteindex.json`, `D.iic` icon names → icons). Not full UI frame kits.
